  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can spread an impressive-sounding rumor about your capabilities with 1 hour of effort in a settlement or among members of an organization. You can also reveal this rumor as a plan; revealing such a plan is a move action. Its effect costs no action from you if you did not reveal it as a plan. Spreading rumors about your reputation can make creatures in that settlement or group overestimate your capabilities when they first encounter you.</p>\n<p>You attempt an Intimidate check to pose a menace when you spread the rumor and apply the result to the first time you encounter each creature from that group or settlement who has not encountered you before or since you last gained a level. The creature gains the impressed condition for 1 hour upon meeting you, plus an additional hour for every 5 points that you exceed the DC (this impressed condition is applied before any change to the creature’s attitude).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/bluster#toc11\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
